<p id="p1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:144%;">Supplementary Material for Inner Speech as Behavior Guides<span id="p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></p>
