<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A7.F11.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 11</span>: </span><span id="A7.F11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Conditional generation on the Aligning dataset. The color gradient (Plasma) shows the simulation time going from 0 (dark purple) to the end (bright yellow), going through red and orange. Inner speech updates are marked as yellow circles with corresponding times inside; the first inner speech is equal to the specified condition.</span></figcaption>
